    'A 28-year-old has had no periods since a dilatation and curettage for retained products 9 months ago. Pregnancy test is negative; FSH, prolactin and TSH are normal. She has no withdrawal bleed after progesterone, nor after combined oestrogen and progesterone. Where is the problem, and what is the likely cause?',
